==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɛbɪŋ|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A sturdy woven fabric
#: ''The '''webbing''' of the lawn chair made marks on his thigh.''
# {{label|en|military}} A [[belt]] and shoulder [[harness]] with attached [[pouch]]es used to carry a soldier's equipment, water, ammunition, etc.
# {{label|en|baseball}} The part of a baseball mitt between the forefinger and thumb, the [[web]]
#: ''He caught the ball in the '''webbing'''.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|military}} {{l|en|web gear}}, {{l|en|web belt}}

